{
 "slug": "grubmarket-ai-alternative",
 "pageId": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
 "text_batches": [
  [
   {
    "label": "t0",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "c3df870f-ba8c-9aaf-796c-bb1249eeefa3"
     },
     "text": "20-30 Min"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t1",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fe9d"
     },
     "text": "Saved on each order taken off the phone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t2",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "3027ca32-6180-79a6-1a66-d9f911e27a08"
     },
     "text": "24-48 Hrs"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t3",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fea2"
     },
     "text": "Is how long most distributors wait to go live"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t4",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "448bf1fe-361f-3c13-6268-4572092953ba"
     },
     "text": "24/7"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t5",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5feac"
     },
     "text": "Is when an account can place its order"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t6",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "1cd5e3b3-4adf-89d2-b8a1-ba35fe69754d"
     },
     "text": "Why Teams Compare"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t7",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8be"
     },
     "text": "Why teams want an alternative to GrubMarket AI"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t8",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8c2"
     },
     "text": "GrubMarket AI calls GrubAssist a virtual assistant for the food supply chain. The jobs it advertises include business analysis, performance, cash flow, spotting unusual numbers and creating orders. All useful, and worth keeping. A GrubMarket AI alternative search usually starts from one gap: the customer still sends a message that somebody has to work out."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t9",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "eb7fd825-30c6-7275-9a2f-c98f68eb960f"
     },
     "text": "Their site describes an assistant for your team"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t10",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8cc"
     },
     "text": "The jobs GrubAssist advertises are ones a distributor's team does: looking into the numbers and writing up orders. Even if that speeds up order entry, it is not the same as the customer building the order themselves."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t11",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "bacfcf90-d337-55e1-9a02-49b2f6962e16"
     },
     "text": "Their AI still starts from a loose message"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t12",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8d3"
     },
     "text": "GrubMarket's order-reading tool reads voicemail, email and text messages at any hour, which is useful. Each one still begins as a message, though, and the kitchen that sent it never sees the lines it became."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t13",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "83921d0d-4ec1-911e-4420-fee5bfd13614"
     },
     "text": "The assistant is the part worth keeping"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t14",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8da"
     },
     "text": "If GrubAssist already tells your team how accounts are trending, swapping it out to change how ordering works would throw away the bit that does its job."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t15",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "f5b08e4d-7503-2dae-cdd2-6f455d9fe83d"
     },
     "text": "A GrubMarket AI alternative for the customer's side"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t16",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "f49b7c29-2a8e-b047-d714-742b52e0a34c"
     },
     "text": "What You Get"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t17",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "d4031fde-2fc3-b283-bb1c-784e741d725b"
     },
     "text": "Voice Ordering"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t18",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0ed"
     },
     "text": "The kitchen talks, and your desk reads"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t19",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0f1"
     },
     "text": "A chef counts what is low and says it into their own phone. Each item comes up as a line with a quantity, they correct anything wrong, and they send it. That is the whole exchange, and your team is not in it."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t20",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4133"
     },
     "text": "Nothing arrives that your customer has not looked at"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t21",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4139"
     },
     "text": "From a walk-in or a bench, whenever the shift ends"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t22",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe413f"
     },
     "text": "Saves 20 to 30 minutes compared with the same order by phone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t23",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4145"
     },
     "text": "Interrupted halfway? It holds the order until they come back"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t24",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "d5d6538b-4114-51aa-7fff-aad875b7bfe3"
     },
     "text": "Order Guides"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t25",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea2"
     },
     "text": "Your lists are the only setup there is"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t26",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea6"
     },
     "text": "There is nothing to train. You send the lists you already keep for each customer. We load them with your SKUs and the prices you set for that account, and setup is done."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t27",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdead"
     },
     "text": "A kitchen sees nothing but the lines it buys"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t28",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb3"
     },
     "text": "Pricing and the catalog remain yours to set"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t29",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb9"
     },
     "text": "Change a list once and the next orders follow it"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t30",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdebf"
     },
     "text": "Nothing to adjust as orders or product lines grow"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t31",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "6555f9fc-4dcc-b940-f384-6001ce4db69f"
     },
     "text": "Delivery Formats"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t32",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb118"
     },
     "text": "Delivered in the format you asked for"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t33",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb11c"
     },
     "text": "A finished order leaves as an email carrying a PDF, Excel or Word file, or goes straight into your ERP over the API, over EDI, or into QuickBooks, in a format your desk opens every day."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t34",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb123"
     },
     "text": "Addressed to a rep, or to the purchasing desk"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t35",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb129"
     },
     "text": "Over EDI, the API or QuickBooks, nobody on your team retypes it"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t36",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb12f"
     },
     "text": "Picking, billing and delivery carry on unchanged"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t37",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb135"
     },
     "text": "You do not have to remove any software first"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t38",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "099f67ce-06ef-dc92-c6e6-fdc4481f359f"
     },
     "text": "Inventory Visibility"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t39",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93a"
     },
     "text": "What is on hand, as the orders come in"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t40",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93e"
     },
     "text": "VoiceOrder Solutions carries real-time inventory visibility tied to what is being ordered, and the catalog updates as stock levels change. It does not replace your stock system: that stays in charge, and a demo shows how the levels connect."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t41",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df945"
     },
     "text": "Every line you carry, not only the quick movers"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t42",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df94b"
     },
     "text": "Fewer stockout surprises on a late, heavy order"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t43",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df951"
     },
     "text": "Stock numbers come from the system you count with today"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t44",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df957"
     },
     "text": "We never count or buy stock for you"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t45",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "021e8cc1-41f6-a5cc-3995-2a8c101d005c"
     },
     "text": "Your Team, Your Customers"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t46",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64e7"
     },
     "text": "GrubAssist for your team, VoiceOrder Solutions for your customers"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t47",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64ec"
     },
     "text": "We are not a GrubMarket AI replacement and do not try to be. Our app covers the customer end, so the tool your staff rely on is left alone."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t48",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da6507"
     },
     "text": "Keep GrubAssist for business questions"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t49",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da650a"
     },
     "text": "Asking out loud how a customer is trending, or where the cash is, is a genuinely useful thing and we cannot do it. Keep it for those questions, and let the customer build the order."
    }
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "label": "t50",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a6d"
     },
     "text": "Fewer messages for the AI to read"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t51",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a70"
     },
     "text": "Each account you move across sends an itemized, approved order rather than a voicemail. Whatever tool reads your messages today keeps handling the ones that still come in."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t52",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535624"
     },
     "text": "One place for these orders to land"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t53",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535627"
     },
     "text": "When our orders travel by EDI, API or into QuickBooks, they reach the same software as everything else, so nobody ends up with two places to look."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t54",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b4"
     },
     "text": "See a customer-spoken order arrive"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t55",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b8"
     },
     "text": "Twenty minutes. A customer speaks an order, approves it, and it arrives on the desk as a PDF, over EDI or over the API."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t56",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "6923bf1d-5310-eba9-bcb8-7266c5f85e97"
     },
     "text": "Getting Started"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t57",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ec7"
     },
     "text": "Three steps, and no AI to train"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t58",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "38293a1d-fb4c-9501-8014-28855f9128b6"
     },
     "text": "Nothing has to be trained, and there is no trial run to plan. You send lists, we set up accounts, and the ordering starts."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t59",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ed6"
     },
     "text": "Share your order guides"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t60",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5eda"
     },
     "text": "Whatever format they are already in. Each account's lines and your prices go into a single admin screen, lined up with your codes."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t61",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ede"
     },
     "text": "We set up each account"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t62",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ee3"
     },
     "text": "Each kitchen downloads the app once its account is ready. Most send something in before the day is out."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t63",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f00"
     },
     "text": "The order shows up done"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t64",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f04"
     },
     "text": "Your customer has approved it, and it is numbered and timestamped, in the format your system takes."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t65",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a176"
     },
     "text": "GrubMarket AI plus VoiceOrder Solutions."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t66",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "0c6cf9c7-bbe3-a64d-76b9-1539a90ac7c8"
     },
     "text": "One for your team, one for your customers."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t67",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "7b8acd63-aca8-b070-4eb6-f64ce47abebc"
     },
     "text": "Team And Customers"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t68",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a179"
     },
     "text": "Adding an app for your customers takes nothing away from your team's tools. Anyone weighing a GrubMarket AI alternative for voice ordering should see both sides, so each row shows GrubMarket AI as you run it today, then with our app added. The two are not connected, and everything said about them is read off grubmarket.ai."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t69",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "1ff87819-9b94-6168-dfbb-e81fd6a5b236"
     },
     "text": "Feature"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t70",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a18d"
     },
     "text": "GrubMarket AI + VoiceOrder Solutions"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t71",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a19e"
     },
     "text": "GrubMarket AI on its own"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t72",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1be"
     },
     "text": "An app your customers speak the order into"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t73",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "89a5813a-10f6-6ba1-6eed-d733971a550a"
     },
     "text": "Not described for customers"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t74",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1c8"
     },
     "text": "Answers questions about your business by voice"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t75",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1d5"
     },
     "text": "Your customer signs off the order before it sends"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t76",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1e2"
     },
     "text": "Pulls orders out of voicemails, emails and texts"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t77",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1ec"
     },
     "text": "Each account has its own list, at your prices"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t78",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1f6"
     },
     "text": "Chatbots trained on your products"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t79",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a210"
     },
     "text": "Market pricing data on thousands of products"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t80",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a21a"
     },
     "text": "Custom AI built by their developers"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t81",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a224"
     },
     "text": "Order number and the time it was sent"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t82",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "30f8c397-6bf9-f190-2eb1-183dc2b44d9e"
     },
     "text": "FAQ"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t83",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf956"
     },
     "text": "Better than GrubMarket AI, or the customer app to run beside it?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t84",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "8bf0eb84-6a8d-dd56-6a0e-8116d9416d3d"
     },
     "text": "Do I need a GrubMarket AI alternative so customers can speak their own orders?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t85",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf967"
     },
     "text": "No. GrubAssist can keep serving your team while VoiceOrder Solutions gives each account its own voice app: speak, check, send. Nothing on your side has to be switched off or retrained."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t86",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "ad9f0390-a776-7031-a95b-984cd1988c9e"
     },
     "text": "Is VoiceOrder Solutions a GrubMarket AI competitor, since both use voice?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t87",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf973"
     },
     "text": "Less than it looks. GrubAssist, going by their own site, works for your team: ask it about the business, have it write up an order. Ours is for your customers, who speak and approve their own orders, so your staff never write up anything placed in our app. That is why a team looking at a GrubMarket AI alternative to get voice orders can simply run both."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t88",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "e219e293-819b-221b-6d80-7f8d2898a4d7"
     },
     "text": "Can your app tell us how a customer is performing?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t89",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf97f"
     },
     "text": "No. Our admin screen shows what each account has ordered and lets you manage accounts and guides. GrubAssist advertises reporting on how accounts perform and we do not, which is a good reason to keep it."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t90",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "39590628-381c-9aea-6095-0746f7348939"
     },
     "text": "Is there any link between GrubAssist and your app?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t91",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf98b"
     },
     "text": "None. Nothing links the two, and neither company supports the other. GrubAssist connects to your ERP so it can answer questions about the business; we only ever deliver approved orders into your system, in the formats listed further up."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t92",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "0f73d180-08e9-596f-f264-a95de40f9593"
     },
     "text": "Do we have to teach your app our catalog?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t93",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "7e541655-5a68-8f96-1273-8249a5c759bd"
     },
     "text": "No. There is nothing to teach, so there is no training tool for it. The item list you keep for an account is all the setup it needs. GrubMarket AI offers an AI training module for its assistant, and that stays theirs to run."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t94",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "d9956fbb-a3d6-4b04-b3ab-98b6f5ae509f"
     },
     "text": "How soon could our accounts be ordering?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t95",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "4446ea80-4c7a-f2a8-f0de-0a222818c94f"
     },
     "text": "For most distributors this is live inside 24 to 48 hours, and customers usually place a first order the day they get their login. GrubAssist carries on as before while it happens. Accounts that keep calling still can; a call just gets no order number or timestamp from us."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t96",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "93ba65b0-4eb0-c64e-d0c0-933cd7a92b1d"
     },
     "text": "How is voice for customers priced next to GrubAssist?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t97",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf997"
     },
     "text": "Neither of us publishes a figure. Ours arrives as a quote once we know your setup; theirs comes after a demo. Keeping GrubAssist means the only cost to weigh is the voice app for your customers."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t98",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-990427524516"
     },
     "text": "Where do the GrubMarket details on this page come from?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t99",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59a6caad0812b5c623",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-99042752451e"
     },
     "text": "Taken from grubmarket.ai on 10 October 2026, which is the GrubMarket AI product rather than GrubMarket the company: the GrubAssist description, the list of advertised jobs, the training module and the other products all come off that page. They publish no price and no rollout time, so this page does not guess at either. If any of it has changed since, the mistake is ours to fix."
    }
   }
  ]
 ],
